# LEAD_MARGIN gems. Lockers chase nearby enemy carriers, else guard the nearest altar.
# Camps: a goal is taken only if its clearing damage (group_threat * group_hp) fits within what we can
# absorb (health * strength * squad), where squad = 1 + allies_within(4). The next goal is tried next.
# If every goal is too dangerous, recall home instead of suiciding.

# ability-type-aware casting (shield/heal on self, dash kept for escape/travel)
def cast_on(slot, u):
    if ability_ready(slot):
        if slot_is_shield(slot) or slot_is_heal(slot):
